  "regimen_incomplete": true,
  "rationale": "Plan correctly withholds ampicillin (L018) per allergy (supported by case), but introduces clindamycin (L020) which is not endorsed for EOS in NICE NG195 (S007/S008). It also fails to specify gentamicin dose (required by S004) and omits the guideline‑preferred alternative (vancomycin) for severe penicillin allergy. These gaps reduce correctness, completeness, utility and safety. Citation mapping is ambiguous, but content of cited passages indicates the contradictions and omissions."
